        "headline": "Special Weather Statement issued October 1 at 2:40PM AKDT by NWS Fairbanks AK",
        "description": "Periods of snow continue through Friday night before gradually\ndrying on Saturday. An additional 1 to 2 inches of\nsnowfall is still possible with overall storm total snowfall\nranging from 2 to 4 inches. Isolated locations under any\npersistent heavier snow may see up to 6 inches total.\n\nWinds will be strongest Thursday night into Friday from Nuiqsut\nto Kaktovik. Wind gusts will be up to 30 mph which may result in\nareas of blowing/drifting snow, lowering visibility at times.",
